    <reapack name="Deactivate.lua" type="script" desc="Perfect Sound: Deactivate this device">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[
Releases this computer's Perfect Sound license binding.

Use this when you want to move your license to another computer
in a clean way (recommended before selling, lending, or formatting
this machine). After deactivating, just sign in normally on the new
computer.

You do NOT need this script for the normal case of moving between
two computers - simply running any Perfect Sound script on the new
machine and signing in will release the previous device automatically.
        ]]></description>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.0.0" author="Perfect Sound" time="2026-05-05T00:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[Initial release.]]></changelog>
        <source main="true" file="Deactivate.lua">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thefloatingroom/Perfect-Sound/main/stubs/Deactivate.lua</source>
      </version>
    </reapack>

